{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"stone_chunk","model_identifier":"stone_chunk","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## stone_chunk\n\nCarried load, stone.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -6.3..7.0, y -3.0..4.9, z -9.1..0.3 (size 13.3 x 7.9 x 9.4 u = 37 x 22 x 26 cm).\nStone chunk: a grey, roughly broken block (~25 cm) with darker cracks and pale faces. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## stone_chunk\n\nCarried load, stone.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -6.3..7.0, y -3.0..4.9, z -9.1..0.3 (size 13.3 x 7.9 x 9.4 u = 37 x 22 x 26 cm).\nStone chunk: a grey, roughly broken block (~25 cm) with darker cracks and pale faces. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"rock","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,-3.0,-8.5],"to":[4.5,4.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,0,27.0,7.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[9,8,17.0,15.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,8,9.0,15.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[17,8,25.0,15.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,9.0,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,18.0,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a2d501c0-c03b-5235-acdc-43785bc304d8"},{"name":"rock_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_e